WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.704
Start a local demo session. Identity stays on the server.

00:00:07.704 --> 00:00:11.510
Load Lighthouse before sending a request.

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:20.902
OpenAI streams the named plan into text chat.

00:00:20.902 --> 00:00:24.700
Save completed text with the loaded server version.

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:28.614
A browser refresh starts a fresh capture.

00:00:28.614 --> 00:00:32.464
Load the saved thread. No model request.

00:00:32.464 --> 00:00:39.918
The next request includes the saved conversation.

00:00:39.918 --> 00:00:43.714
Another client saves a newer server version.

00:00:43.714 --> 00:00:47.852
Save returns 409. Unsaved text stays visible.

00:00:47.852 --> 00:00:51.756
Reload explicitly adopts the newer server snapshot.

00:00:51.756 --> 00:00:55.564
Review the actual HTTP operations and SDK messages.

00:00:55.564 --> 00:01:14.750
Replay makes no requests or writes.

00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:22.467
Back live.
